{
  "name": "other-02-app-server-signed-in",
  "what": "`codex app-server` in a home holding a made-up ChatGPT sign-in (auth.json with unsigned tokens) whose backend is a local server: account/read names the account, model/list fetches the account's list from <chatgpt_base_url>/codex/models and caches it in models_cache.json. Two extra --config overrides (chatgpt_base_url, openai_base_url) and SSL_CERT_FILE, none of which Tarsee passes, keep the made-up token on this machine.",
